    "title": "Bringing back Blacksburg's \"spark\": Town introduces facade improvement program for businesses - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lindsey Cook ,\n7 hours ago BLACKSBURG, Va. (WDBJ) - A new facade improvement program offered by the town of Blacksburg is aiming to help local businesses stand out downtown and look better than ever. Blacksburg Books is one of the first businesses you see driving into the heart of Downtown Blacksburg, but owner Lori Kelly said the shop can still go unnoticed. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
